03:43:49,360 --> 03:43:57,520
例如，这个 from Ubuntu，因为没有列出标签和版本号，这意味着请拉取最新的 base
So this one, for example, from Ubuntu means since there is no column and tag, that means please pull the latest base

2257
03:43:57,760 --> 03:44:02,244
Ubuntu 镜像，接下来的指令都将基于 Ubuntu。
Ubuntu image, and the following instructions are going to be based on Ubuntu.

2258
03:44:05,550 --> 03:44:10,852
当你的 Dockerfile 中包含多个指令时，在构建镜像时，
When you have a Docker file that has multiple instructions, when an image is built,

