03:44:21,070 --> 03:44:27,620
例如，这里如果一个 Docker 镜像 有四个层，这可能对应我们之前的文件内容。
So for example, here, if we have a Docker image that has four layers, this could be corresponding to the file that we had.

2261
03:44:28,128 --> 03:44:35,684
所以 from 会对应一个层，maintainer 会对应一个层，run 会对应一个层，command 也会对应一个层。
So the from is going to map to a layer, the maintainer is going to map to a layer, the run will map to a layer, and the command will map to the layer.

2262
03:44:35,968 --> 03:44:44,196
为什么是这样？为什么要按这种结构构建？这是关于 Docker images 所使用的联合文件系统的长篇故事。
