2263
03:44:44,368 --> 03:44:55,248
但核心点很简单，如果你有这些彼此隔离的层，那么如果你想基于这个镜像构建一个衍生镜像，假设我稍后
But the point simply is if you have these segregated from each other, then if you want to build a derivative from this image, let's say I go later on

