04:11:57,198 --> 04:12:05,924
如果你是手动运行、手动构建镜像之类的，它不会自动发布端口或者把宿主机和容器关联起来。
If you are running manually and building images manually and all that, it's not going to do the publishing of the port or link the host to the container.

2543
04:12:06,272 --> 04:12:10,352
也就是说，它并不会真正把端口暴露给宿主机。
So it does not actually publish or expose the port open to the host.

