现在让我们来了解 Docker 网络。
Now let's go over the Docker networking.

3353
05:25:35,790 --> 05:25:38,884
当你创建容器时，它们如何进行通信？
When you create containers, how can they communicate?

3354
05:25:39,374 --> 05:25:47,328
它们如何与外部世界通信？以及它们如何能被来自外部网络或互联网的请求访问？
And how can they communicate to the outside world and how can they be available to communicate with from the outside, from external networks, from the internet?

3355
05:25:47,918 --> 05:25:49,572
这些内容将在本节中涵盖。
So this will be covered in this section.

3356
05:25:51,470 --> 05:25:53,060
让我们先从概览开始。
Let's start with an overview.

3357
05:25:53,870 --> 05:25:57,968
退后一步，我们来聊聊一种叫做网桥的网络设备。
Take a step back and let's talk about a network device called a bridge.

3358
05:25:58,254 --> 05:26:05,284
什么是网络网桥？这不只是关于 Docker 的问题，这是从网络领域的通用角度来说的。
What is a network network bridge? This is not about Docker. This is generally speaking from the networking space, from the networking domain.

3359
05:26:05,968 --> 05:26:11,844
网桥是一个数据链路层，或者说 OSI 模型中的第二层物理或虚拟设备。
A bridge is a data link layer or OSI layer 2 physical or virtual device.

3360
05:26:12,942 --> 05:26:17,088
什么是数据链路层？在 OSI 模型中，我们有七个层级。
What is the data link layer? On the OSI layer, we have seven layers.

3361
05:26:17,328 --> 05:26:20,324
第一层是布线和电信号。
The first one is the cabling and electrical signals.

3362
05:26:20,846 --> 05:26:25,604
第二层涉及网络接口、Ethernet 连接等等。
The second one is about the network interfaces, the Ethernet connectivity, and so on.

3363
05:26:25,888 --> 05:26:30,500
然后第三层是关于 ip addr，第四层是关于端口等等。
And then layer 3 is about the IP addresses, layer 4 is about the ports and so on.

3364
05:26:30,608 --> 05:26:32,068
所以我不想深入讨论这些。
So I don't want to get into that.

3365
05:26:32,288 --> 05:26:36,196
它本质上是一个不识别 ip addr 的设备。
It is a device that does not understand IP addresses basically.

3366
05:26:37,248 --> 05:26:40,388
它可以把多个网络段连接在一起。
And it can connect multiple network segments together.

3367
05:26:40,928 --> 05:26:46,340
如果我在网络段一上有 PC 或客户端，
So if I have PCs or clients on segment one,

3368
05:26:47,278 --> 05:26:53,700
而在网络段二上有客户端，可能是 PC、服务器，或者比如是数据中心。
and I have clients on segment two, there could be PCs, there could be servers, this could be the data center, for example.

3369
05:26:54,158 --> 05:26:58,628
我想让这一侧和那一侧之间能够通信。
And I would like to allow communication from this side to this side.

3370
05:26:59,054 --> 05:27:05,732
当我提到“段”时，我指的是两者之间独立的网络段。
And when I'm talking about segments, I'm talking about separate networking segments between the two.

3371
05:27:06,254 --> 05:27:09,956
所以网桥允许从一侧到另一侧的通信。
So the bridge allows the communication from one side to the other.

3372
05:27:10,542 --> 05:27:19,088
这样 PC2 和 PC3 就能毫无问题地通信，PC1 和 PC4 甚至也能顺利通信，还有 PC5 和 PC6
So PC2 and PC3 can communicate without issues, PC1 and PC4 can even communicate without issues, PC5 and PC6

3373
05:27:19,328 --> 05:27:20,708
它们也能顺畅通信。
they can communicate without issues.

3374
05:27:21,008 --> 05:27:23,716
这就是网桥在逻辑上的定义。
That's logically what a bridge is.

3375
05:27:25,678 --> 05:27:27,172
那它长什么样呢？
Now, how does it look like?

3376
05:27:27,630 --> 05:27:32,132
我们每个人家里都有某种形式的网桥。
All of us we have a form of a bridge in our homes.

3377
05:27:32,590 --> 05:27:37,508
如果你家有网络连接，就会有一个小设备，有时被称为路由器。
If you have internet connection in your home, there will be a small device, they call it the router sometimes.

3378
05:27:38,062 --> 05:27:44,452
但如果你去看那个设备，你会看到背面有这样的端口。
But if you go to that device, you will see in the back side that it has ports like this.

3379
05:27:45,134 --> 05:27:49,892
这些端口使用我们所谓的 RJ45 连接器进行连接。
And the ports connect using what we call RG45 connectors.

3380
05:27:50,382 --> 05:27:54,340
这些连接器是公头，而这是母头。
So these connectors are the male connectors, and this is the female connector.

3381
05:27:54,624 --> 05:28:02,980
它卡在里面，这里的那个小卡扣会卡在这个位置，这样就能固定在原位。
It latches inside, and then the little latch here will clip in this place, and that's how it gets fixed in place.

3382
05:28:04,334 --> 05:28:09,316
PC 是如何连接到网络设备的，无论是网桥、交换机还是集线器？
How can a PC connect to a network device, whether it is a bridge or a switch or even a hub?

3383
05:28:10,094 --> 05:28:17,444
这条线一端连接到设备，另一端连接到 PC 或服务器等。
Then that cable connects on one side to the device, and on the other side it connects in the PC or the server or so on.

3384
05:28:18,478 --> 05:28:20,836
这就是连接建立的方式。
So that's how connectivity happens.

3385
05:28:21,744 --> 05:28:32,944
这些端口中的每一个都叫 Ethernet 端口。什么是 Ethernet？它是 OSI 层 2 的标准协议。目前你不需要了解更多。
And each one of these ports is called an Ethernet port. What is Ethernet? It's a standard protocol for OSI layer 2. You don't need to understand more than this for now.

3386
05:28:33,104 --> 05:28:42,564
只需记住，Ethernet 是网络设备上的接口，也是 PC 或服务器上网卡或网络接口卡上的接口
Just remember that Ethernet is an interface on the network device and an interface on the neck card or the network interface card on the PC or the server

3387
05:28:42,944 --> 05:28:46,020
或者是连接到那个网桥或交换机上的设备。
or the device connected to that bridge or switch.

3388
05:28:47,406 --> 05:28:50,916
所以这是用通俗易懂的语言来解释什么是网桥，非常基础的内容。
So this is in Lehman terms, very basic what a bridge is.

3389
05:28:51,184 --> 05:28:59,620
为什么要把这个引入讨论？因为宿主机内的 Docker 会构建软件网桥，即虚拟网桥。
Why did we bring this into the discussion? Because Docker inside the host it builds software bridges, virtual bridges.

3390
05:29:00,238 --> 05:29:04,356
记住，在这张幻灯片中我们说过，它可以是物理设备或虚拟设备。
Remember, in this slide we said it can be a physical or a virtual device.

3391
05:29:04,718 --> 05:29:10,628
这就是为什么 Docker 会在宿主机内部建立虚拟设备。
And that's why Docker will establish the virtual device inside the Docker host.

3392
05:29:11,150 --> 05:29:21,028
这就是网桥网络，它是一种软件网桥，允许连接到该网桥的容器在宿主机内相互通信。
And that is a bridge network, which is a software bridge to allow containers connected to that bridge to communicate with one another inside the host.

3393
05:29:23,662 --> 05:29:29,693
默认情况下，当我们启动宿主机中的 Docker 时，会创建一个名为 docker0 的网桥网络。
By default, when we start Docker inside a host, a bridge network called docker zero.

3394
05:29:29,904 --> 05:29:34,916
因此，会自动创建一个名为 docker0 的软件网桥。
So a software bridge with the name Docker Zero is created automatically.

3395
05:29:35,790 --> 05:29:39,396
所以你不需要手动创建它，它是 Docker 自带的默认设置。
So you don't have to create it, it comes with Docker by default.

3396
05:29:39,758 --> 05:29:47,824
并且任何默认创建的容器都会连接到 docker0，并且会在网桥上创建一个虚拟以太网端口
And any container that will be created by default will connect into Docker Zero, and there will be a virtual Ethernet port

3397
05:29:48,462 --> 05:29:52,384
这个端口就在这里创建，用于连接容器。
that will be created here on the bridge to connect the container.

3398
05:29:52,590 --> 05:29:55,140
随着课程的推进，我们将更详细地讨论这一点。
We'll discuss this in more detail as we move forward.

3399
05:29:57,422 --> 05:30:01,904
那么，只有网桥才能实现宿主机内的网络通信吗？
So, is it only a bridge that can allow networking within a host?

3400
05:30:02,064 --> 05:30:13,892
在 Docker 中，我们称之为网络驱动或网络模式。Docker 网络模式包括多种可以在 Docker 宿主机内实现的不同类型的网络。
In Docker, we have what we call network drivers or network modes. So Docker network modes include many different types of networking that you can do inside the Docker host.

3401
05:30:14,304 --> 05:30:19,332
其中包括网桥，它是默认的网络驱动或默认的网络模式。
And that includes bridge, which is the default network driver or the default network mode.

3402
05:30:20,206 --> 05:30:21,540
接下来是 宿主机。
Then we have host.

3403
05:30:22,704 --> 05:30:29,424
宿主机 模式下，容器基本上会遵循宿主机的 IP 栈。
The host basically will have the containers follow the host IP stack.

3404
05:30:29,582 --> 05:30:37,284
所以它们没有自己的 IP 地址，就像是 Docker 宿主机的延伸一样。我们稍后也会详细讨论这一点。
So they don't have their own IP addresses. They are just as if they are extension to the Docker host. We'll talk about that in detail as well later on.

3405
05:30:37,742 --> 05:30:40,384
然后是 none，即完全没有网络连接。
And then we have none, no networking whatsoever.

3406
05:30:40,464 --> 05:30:49,860
在这种情况下，宿主机内的容器无法与外部任何事物通信，也无法与其他容器通信，外部或外部网络也无法连接到该容器。
The container inside the host cannot communicate with anything outside, cannot communicate with the other containers, and the outside or external networks cannot communicate to the container.

3407
05:30:50,094 --> 05:30:51,396
这一点我们也会详细说明。
Also, we'll detail that.

3408
05:30:52,304 --> 05:30:53,956
接下来是 overlay。
Then we have overlay.

3409
05:30:54,446 --> 05:31:04,228
记住，网桥和 宿主机 是在讨论 Docker 宿主机内部的通信。如果我在另一个宿主机上有容器，并想把这两个连接起来怎么办？
Remember that the bridge and the host, this we are talking about networking inside a Docker host. What if I have containers in another host and I would like to connect the two together?

3410
05:31:04,590 --> 05:31:10,464
在这种情况下，你需要 overlay 网络，它可以将多个 Docker 守护进程连接在一起。
Then in that case, you need the overlay network which can connect multiple Docker daemons together.

3411
05:31:10,638 --> 05:31:13,412
这超出了我们的范围，所以我们不打算涵盖这一部分。
This is far from our scope, so we're not going to cover that.

3412
05:31:14,384 --> 05:31:20,964
接下来是 IPVLAN 网络，它提供对 IPv4 和 IPv6 地址的完全控制。
Then we have IP VLAN networks, which provides full control over the IPv4 and IPv6 addressing.

3413
05:31:21,678 --> 05:31:31,876
然后是 MACVLAN，它会为容器分配 MAC 地址。在 OSI 模型中，第二层的地址被称为 MAC 地址。这是我们提到的以太网的一部分。
Then we have the MAC VLAN, which will assign MAC addresses to containers. Layer 2, OSI, layer 2 addresses are called MAC addresses. This is part of Ethernet that we mentioned.

3414
05:31:32,494 --> 05:31:42,304
最后是用户自定义，即构建自定义网络。我们也会研究这个。在进行实操练习时，我们将构建自定义的网桥网络。
And then user-defined, building custom networks, and we are going to look at this one as well. We are going to build custom bridge networks as we work through the hands-on apps.

3415
05:31:42,464 --> 05:31:51,780
好了，现在让我们深入探讨 Docker 网桥模式。这是第一个也是默认的模式，称为 Docker 网桥驱动。
Alright, now let's dive into the Docker bridge mode. The very first one, the default one, the Docker bridge mode, or it's called the Docker Bridge Driver.

3416
05:31:53,230 --> 05:31:57,264
连接到同一个网桥网络的容器可以互相通信。
So containers connected to the same bridge network can communicate.

3417
05:31:57,518 --> 05:32:06,276
默认情况下，你有 Docker 宿主机，它会自动创建 docker0。我们说过，只要启动 Docker，就会有一个 docker0 网桥。
So by default, you have the Dockerhost and it creates Docker Zero by default. We said as soon as you start Docker, there will be a Docker Zero bridge.

3418
05:32:07,182 --> 05:32:15,140
那么你创建的容器如果保留默认的网络设置，它们就会处于同一个网桥上，并且能够互相通信。
Then containers that you create and you leave them to the default networking settings are going to be on the same bridge and they should be able to communicate with one another.

3419
05:32:16,622 --> 05:32:27,216
网桥网络将不同网桥上的容器彼此隔离。那么，如果我创建一个自定义网桥？假设是 网桥 one，然后我有容器三和四在 网桥 one 上。
A bridge network isolates the containers from other containers on other bridges. So, what if I create a custom bridge? Let's say bridge one, and then I have container three and four on bridge one.

3420
05:32:27,536 --> 05:32:32,176
那么 docker0 上的容器能与 网桥 one 上的容器通信吗？答案是否定的。
Can the ones on Docker 0 and the ones on bridge one communicate? The answer is no.

3421
05:32:32,494 --> 05:32:36,996
默认情况下，每个网桥都不允许与其他网桥通信。
Each bridge will not allow by default communication to the other bridges.

3422
05:32:37,550 --> 05:32:41,188
网桥网络仅在同一个 Docker宿主机内生效。
Bridge networks apply within the same Docker host only.

3423
05:32:41,376 --> 05:32:42,244
我们现在有的是
What we have

3424
05:32:43,054 --> 05:32:47,044
我们现在的重点是网桥模式，也就是网桥驱动。
now we are focused on bridge mode, bridge driver.

3425
05:32:47,310 --> 05:32:52,996
所以在网桥模式和网桥驱动中，一个网桥仅存在于宿主机内，无法扩展到其他宿主机。
So in bridge mode and bridge driver, a bridge is within the host only, cannot extend to other hosts.

3426
05:32:54,096 --> 05:33:01,296
一个容器可以同时连接到多个网桥网络，我们将在进入实操环节时演示这一点。
A container can connect to multiple bridge networks at the same time, and we are going to demo that as we look into

3427
05:33:02,318 --> 05:33:12,004
如果我有容器 2，并且它需要与容器 3 和容器 4 通信，我可以为该容器建立第二个连接。
the hands-on apps. So if I have container two and it needs communication with container three and container four, I can have a second connection to the container.

3428
05:33:12,256 --> 05:33:22,852
那么这里会为容器 2 创建一个 Ethernet 端口或虚拟以太网端口。而且在 docker0 上也已经为容器 2 创建了一个。
So there will be an Ethernet port or a virtual Ethernet port here created for container two. And there was already one here created on Docker 0 for container 2 as well.

3429
05:33:23,150 --> 05:33:33,216
容器 2 一旦连接到两个网桥，就能与 1、3 和 4 通信。我们将在实验中演示这一点。
Container 2, as soon as it connects to both bridges, it will be able to communicate with 1, with 3, and with 4. And we're going to demo demo that in the lab.

3430
05:33:35,696 --> 05:33:43,172
现在让我们深入探讨一下 docker0 的网络，也就是任何 Docker宿主机上默认发生的网络。
So let's dive a little deeper into the networking in Docker 0 or the default networking that happens on any Docker host.

3431
05:33:43,566 --> 05:33:54,736
默认的 Docker网桥网络被称为 docker0，而分配给连接到此网桥的容器的 IP 子网（即 IP 地址块）
So the default Docker bridge network, it's called Docker Zero and the IP subnet, the block of IP addresses from which the containers that you create and that will be connected to this bridge

3432
05:33:54,990 --> 05:33:59,376
默认是 172.17.0.0。
will be assigned IP addresses, is by default 172.17.00.

3433
05:34:01,056 --> 05:34:09,153
所以 /16 表示这是分配唯一 IP 地址的范围，也就是一个地址池。
So slash 16 means this is the range from which unique IP addresses will be assigned one pair

3434
05:34:09,296 --> 05:34:12,932
这些地址分配给在网桥上创建或连接到网桥的容器。
container that gets created on the bridge or gets connected to the bridge.

3435
05:34:13,742 --> 05:34:14,816
好的，没问题。
All right, no worries.

3436
05:34:14,990 --> 05:34:22,660
所以我们有 docker0，并且有 172.17.0.0/16 作为 IP 地址的范围或块。
So we have Docker 0 and we have 172.17.0016 as the range of or the block of IP addresses.

3437
05:34:23,296 --> 05:34:31,140
该区块中的第一个 IP 地址将作为连接网桥 docker0 和 Dockerhost 之间的默认网关。
The very first IP address in that block is going to be the IP default gateway between the bridge Docker 0 and the Dockerhost.

3438
05:34:31,438 --> 05:34:41,936
也就是说，docker0 与 Docker宿主机之间的这种连接是通过这个 IP 地址传递的，也就是 IP 默认网关 172.17.0.1。
So this connection between Docker 0 and the Docker host, it passes by the IP address, which is the IP default gateway 172.17.0.1.

3439
05:34:42,256 --> 05:34:47,056
它承担了一些路由功能，因此它可以连接不同的网络。
And this does some routing function. So it can connect discrete networks.

3440
05:34:47,216 --> 05:34:50,372
这个范围与宿主机上的范围不同。
This is a range different than what is on the host.

3441
05:34:50,830 --> 05:34:57,604
那么它们如何通信呢？必须在 docker0 的网关部分进行一些路由。
So how can they communicate? There has to be some routing that is happened on that gateway part of Docker Zero.

3442
05:34:59,918 --> 05:35:07,492
当我们创建一个容器时，除非另有说明，否则每个新容器都会连接到 docker0。
When we create a container, unless we specify otherwise, then every new container will be connected to Docker Zero.

3443
05:35:07,616 --> 05:35:12,644
你创建的任何容器都会连接到 docker0。但这种连接是如何实现的呢？
Any container that you create will be connected to Docker Zero. But how would that connection happen?

3444
05:35:13,038 --> 05:35:20,868
连接发生在容器上创建的 Ethernet 0 接口（软件接口，虚拟的）
The connection will happen between an Ethernet Zero interface, software interface virtual, that will be created on the container

3445
05:35:21,296 --> 05:35:25,572
和在网桥上创建的虚拟以太网接口之间。
and a virtual Ethernet interface that will be created on the bridge.

3446
05:35:25,806 --> 05:35:33,156
这是一个逻辑上的、软件层面的绑定，就像我们之前视频里提到的那种电缆一样。
And this is a logical, a software binding between the two, as if it was the cable that we were talking about in the previous video.

3447
05:35:34,702 --> 05:35:41,828
正如我们提到的，在网桥模式下创建的每个容器都有一个 Ethernet 0，并且会分配到一个 IP 地址。
Each container created in bridge mode has an Ethernet zero as we mentioned, and the IP address gets assigned to it.

3448
05:35:42,126 --> 05:35:53,456
因此，每个容器都会从这个范围内获得一个唯一的宿主机 IP 地址，而不会重复使用之前用过的地址。比如 .1 是网关。
So each container gets a unique host IP address from this range without duplicating what we have used before. So number one or dot one is the gateway.

3449
05:35:53,616 --> 05:35:59,492
创建的第一个容器将是 .2，第二个是 .3，第三个是 .4，以此类推。
The very first container created will be dot two the second will be dot three the third will be dot four, and so on.

3450
05:35:59,822 --> 05:36:07,108
所以这些是唯一的 IP 地址，我们有一个很大的池子，可以从中挑选一个未使用的唯一 IP 并分配给新容器。
So unique IP addresses, and we have a large pool from which we can pick a unique unused IP address and assign it to a new container.

3451
05:36:09,536 --> 05:36:17,540
虚拟以太网接口就是物理网桥上物理端口的虚拟版本。
Virtual Ethernet interfaces are exactly virtual version of the physical ports that are on the physical bridges.

3452
05:36:17,856 --> 05:36:25,636
所以你可以把虚拟接口理解为：它就像是物理接口一样，只不过它是通过软件实现的。
So you can think of what is a virtual interface. This is exactly as if it was a physical one, but this is in software.

3453
05:36:26,382 --> 05:36:35,936
这就是虚拟接口的含义。一个摸不到、只是软件存在的接口，我们没法去抓握它，也没法给它插网线。
So that's the meaning of a virtual interface. An interface that cannot be touched, it's only software, and we cannot hold it or we cannot connect a cable into it.

3454
05:36:36,096 --> 05:36:43,536
而这种绑定也是在软件层面实现的，是在以太网和网桥上的虚拟以太网接口之间进行的绑定。
And this binding that happens is also software binding between Ethernet and the virtual Ethernet interface that is on the bridge.

3455
05:36:43,616 --> 05:36:53,316
所以，容器里创建了以太网，网桥上有虚拟以太网，两者之间的绑定就像是它们之间连接了一根网线一样。
So the Ethernet gets created in the container and the virtual Ethernet on the bridge, and the binding between the two is as if we have a cable connected between them.

3456
05:36:56,238 --> 05:36:57,284
好的，没问题。
Alright, that's fine.

3457
05:36:57,742 --> 05:36:59,076
现在的问题是：
So the question now.

3458
05:36:59,566 --> 05:37:04,356
我们仍然处于默认网桥模式，也就是 Docker 的默认网络模式。
We are still in the default bridge mode, the default networking mode in Docker.

3459
05:37:05,008 --> 05:37:13,408
当我创建一个容器且不指定任何网络配置时，正如我们提到的，会有一个以太网接口，
When I create a container and I don't specify anything for the networking, as we mentioned, there will be an Ethernet interface,

3460
05:37:13,614 --> 05:37:22,212
一个来自默认范围的 ip addr 会被分配，并且在网桥上会创建一个虚拟以太网接口，两者之间会建立绑定。
an IP address from the default range will get assigned, and a virtual Ethernet interface will be created on the bridge, and binding will happen between the two.

3461
05:37:22,606 --> 05:37:23,143
好的。
all right.

3462
05:37:23,694 --> 05:37:32,260
问题是：如果存在外部网络，宿主机可以访问这些外部网络。假设这些是在互联网上的网站或其他内容。
So the question is: if I have external networks, the host can reach these external networks. Let's say these are on the internet, websites or whatever on the internet.

3463
05:37:33,168 --> 05:37:39,972
那么处于默认网桥模式的容器，能够访问这些外部站点吗？
Would the container in the default bridge mode be able to access the external sites?

3464
05:37:40,302 --> 05:37:49,796
例如，容器能 Ping 通 8.8.8.8 这个 ip addr，也就是 Google DNS 吗？
So, for example, would the container be able to ping the 8.8.8.8 IP address, which is the Google DNS,

3465
05:37:50,128 --> 05:37:51,428
它能做到这一点吗？
would it be able to do this?

3466
05:37:52,142 --> 05:37:55,488
如果宿主机能做到，容器也能做到吗？
If the host can do it, would the container be able to do it?

3467
05:37:55,662 --> 05:37:57,408
答案是肯定的。
And the answer is absolutely yes.

3468
05:37:57,648 --> 05:38:00,068
出站连接。我们称之为“出站”。
Outbound connectivity. We call this outbound.

3469
05:38:00,366 --> 05:38:06,628
出站意味着请求是从这里发起，并发往外部网络。
Outbound means it's coming from here initiated and it's going out to the external networks.

3470
05:38:07,054 --> 05:38:15,488
所以它离开容器，通过 ip 网关到达宿主机，进入 Docker 宿主机的以太网 0 接口，
So it's going out of the container, it reaches the host through the IP gateway, gets to the interface Ethernet Zero of the Docker

3471
05:38:15,648 --> 05:38:18,020
然后它会被路由到外部。
host, and then it will route it outside.

3472
05:38:18,510 --> 05:38:27,008
现在问题是：虽然这是在互联网上，但这是一个私有IP地址，私有IP地址在互联网上是不可见的，
Now the question is: if this is on the internet, but this is a private IP address, a private IP address cannot be seen on the internet,

3473
05:38:27,568 --> 05:38:35,076
那么它如何被掩盖，让互联网认为它是从互联网上的某个地方发出的呢？
then how can this be masked such that the internet will see that this is coming from somewhere on the internet?

3474
05:38:35,598 --> 05:38:42,052
然后当响应返回时，这个过程会再次反转，并发送到正确的容器。
And then when the response comes back, then this will be reversed again and it will be sent to the right container.

3475
05:38:42,894 --> 05:38:46,308
答案是网络地址转换。
And the answer is network address translation.

3476
05:38:47,214 --> 05:38:55,524
宿主机会在流量发出以及响应返回时执行网络地址转换。
The host will perform network address translation as that traffic is coming out and when the response comes back.

